  "name": "Zulip",
  "description": "Zulip is an open-source, multi-tenant team collaboration platform featuring a unique topic-based threading model designed for organized asynchronous and real-time communication. The system is built on a high-performance Django and Tornado architecture, leveraging an asynchronous event-loop for server-to-client message delivery and complex analytical data pipelines. It incorporates enterprise-grade capabilities including SCIM provisioning, SAML/OIDC authentication, and a modular integration framework for interactive bots and third-party webhooks.",
